{"v":4,"catch":"DOGOON！\n了解暴力的殘酷與虛榮！","desc":"《VIOLENCE FIGHT》是TAITO於1989年發行的格鬥遊戲。\n遊戲發生在 20 世紀 60 年代初期的美國。來自美國各地的拳擊手齊聚一堂，在 VIOLENCE FIGHT 中擊敗所有對手，贏得獎金和榮譽！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-10-17","genres":["格鬥","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e714caec192b8804a74729b94f464b02e9002fb5c73c850bc13dfaacdd10a9f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d5f94cd129089224dc51783709c9fe10460a614db1f2148894015b590569313e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bfc1f616a953a45a03748e3e525735b8ee868e83ee5d290ba2a64650e4d330aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/37246fb570d7830baf52507564e5bb07bfe5308dded32d2cdecff95aa0b3c7a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ebc24a64fe114d0dfb73cf3cc0e254cfa4ae445f8a9678ecd442503a6f63b46c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ffb98c2974010d02cfcee3fa2e165ff08b4ae9c2340c6a6be89d1f6393952c42.jpg"],"titleId":"010092b01fafe000","dlc":[]}